Changes made to the original work:
  - Calendar logic, month/year navigation, parsing and formatting were
    rewritten to use the Bikram Sambat calendar, with a built-in
    Bikram Sambat <-> Gregorian converter and month-length table.
  - The plugin is registered as $.fn.npdatepicker with its own data key,
    data-api and event namespace.
  - Nepali and English Bikram Sambat locales, Devanagari digit support and
    new options (nativeDigits, pickerClass) were added.
  - Fixes for timezone handling and HTML escaping of tooltips.

The files in dist/css/bootstrap-datepicker*.css are unmodified copies of the
bootstrap-datepicker 1.10.1 stylesheets.
